# Admin tab URLs.
#
# The admin is one page that shows one tab at a time; each tab has its own URL
# so a tab can be linked, bookmarked and reached with the back button. None of
# these paths is a real file, so every one is rewritten (200, not a redirect —
# the URL in the address bar has to survive) to the single admin page, which
# reads location.pathname to decide which tab to open. Both slash forms are
# listed because only an exact path match is rewritten.
/admin/login        /admin/           200
/admin/login/       /admin/           200
/admin/thinking     /admin/           200
/admin/thinking/    /admin/           200
/admin/writing      /admin/           200
/admin/writing/     /admin/           200
/admin/reading      /admin/           200
/admin/reading/     /admin/           200
/admin/sharing      /admin/           200
/admin/sharing/     /admin/           200
/admin/location     /admin/           200
/admin/location/    /admin/           200
/admin/health       /admin/           200
/admin/health/      /admin/           200
